{"id": "q0329", "pool": "easy-fact", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Blue gum and iron bark are species of the Eucalypt us genus. They' re iconic Australian trees, known for their distinctive leaves, essential oils, and often found in various landscapes across Australia.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
