{"id": "q0401", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Shiba Inu is a small Japanese dog breed known for its fox-like appearance and alert expression. They have pointed ears, a curled tail, and a compact build. Shi ba Inus are independent and intelligent, often making them both loyal companion s and challenge d pets to train. They also gained popularity as the mascot of the Doge meme online, which further brought attention to their unique charm.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 25, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0407", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Absolute address in memory is the location of a piece of data or instruction in computer memory, expressed as a fixed numerical value that directly points to its exact position. For example, if a program uses an absolute address like 0x 1234 56, it means the CPU knows exactly where that data lives in physical memory without needing any translation.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 22, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0413", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Aerobic exercise is any activity that gets your heart rate up and makes you breathe harder, like running or swimming. Ana erobic exercise is short bursts of intense effort without using oxygen, such as sprint ing or lifting weights.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0419", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The first thing you should do is find a good pair of running shoes. Make sure they fit well and support your feet properly. Start with short walks, then gradually add some running intervals. Pick a safe route like a park or quiet street. Listen to your body—don' t push too hard at first. Warm up before and cool down after each run. And most importantly, have fun!", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0428", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Gertrude Townend was a prominent figure in the early 20th century. She worked as a socialite, a writer, and an advocate for women's rights. One of her most notable roles was serving as a patron and supporter of the arts, particularly in New York City. She helped promote emerging artists and writers, often hosting gatherings that brought together influential figures from various fields. In addition to her cultural contributions, she also supported charitable causes and was known for her philanthropy. Her influence extended beyond social circles, making her a significant presence in the cultural landscape of her time.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 33, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0433", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, dogs are social animals that have evolved to live with humans. They like us because we provide them with food, shelter, and care. Plus, they' re pack animals by nature, so they naturally form bonds with other members of their group, which includes us.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0440", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Lucid dreams are dreams in which you're aware that you' re dreaming. They can be incredibly vivid and immersive, but they also allow for a lot of control over the dream experience. To learn to luc id dream, there are several techniques you can try. One common method is called reality checking, where you regularly check if you're dreaming throughout the day by performing actions like trying to push on your fingers or looking at objects closely. If these actions don't work as expected, it might indicate you' re dreaming. Another technique is setting intention s before sleep, telling yourself that you want to have a luc id dream. Keeping a dream journal can also help by recording your dreams upon waking, which can improve dream recall and increase awareness during dreams. Practicing mindfulness and meditation can enhance your ability to recognize dream signs, which are elements that frequently appear in dreams and signal that you might be dreaming. With consistent practice, many people find that they start having more luc id dreams over time.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 41, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0444", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, that's a tough one. I think there are several candidates for the title of greatest footballer of all time. Pe le is often mentioned because he won three World Cup s with Brazil in the 1 950s and 60s. He was known for his skill, speed, and goal-scoring ability. Then you have Diego Maradona, who led Ar gentina to victory in 19 86, especially remembered for his incredible handball goal against England and his overall vision on the field. More recently, many people argue that Lionel Messi is the best. He has an amazing career at Barcelona and later Paris Saint- Germain, winning numerous La Liga titles and multiple Ball on d'Or awards. He ’s known for his technical skills and consistency over decades. So while it’s hard to pick just one, I’d say the debate between Pele, Marad ona, and Messi usually comes up when discussing the greatest of all time. What do you think?", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 59, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0451", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, in grade school we study math and reading. Then as you go up through the grades, you start studying history and science.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 7, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0457", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I think that's a really good question. I' m going to give you one of my favorites, which is The Three- Body Problem by C hen Qiuj ie. It's actually the first book in a trilogy. And it's about this alien civilization that comes from another planet, and they have these very strange physical laws. And so it's kind of like a mix between science fiction and physics.And I just think it's a really interesting story. So if you want something that has some science in there, but also a little bit more plot-driven than some of the other ones we've talked about, I would recommend that one.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 29, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0466", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "It's important to practice regularly, and it's helpful to find resources that work for you. For example, using apps like Duolingo or Anki can be great for building vocabular y. Also, try ing to speak with native speakers or watching movies in the language can really help you understand how the language is used naturally.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
